First of all, bravo.
我得說，精彩...

46
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:25,970
But I don't think you're right for this. The part's a stuffy college professor.
但我覺得你真的不適合 這個角色是一個死板的大學教授。

47
00:03:26,130 --> 00:03:30,130
I can do that. Hello, I'm your professor.
也可以啊！ 你好，我是你們的教授。

48
