If anything, I think this could help you. You know what?
我意思是，如果對你有幫助的話

73
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:59,790
Why don't we all go out to dinner, and I can introduce you.
我們可以把他約出來吃個飯啊 我可以把你介紹給他。

74
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:02,860
