Here's my reel. It's got all the commercials that I've been in.
這裡有我的一盤磁帶，裡面有我拍過的所有廣告。

115
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:33,910
- Joe.. - Just watch it.
-喬伊... -你就看一下吧

116
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:36,880
If you don't like it, don't pass it on to your bosses.
如果你不喜歡就別給你上司就是了。

117
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:39,950
- Fine. - Thank you.
-好吧！ -謝謝。

118
00:07:43,930 --> 00:07:46,720
- Work, Joe. - Damn it.
-工作啦，喬伊！ -可惡！

119
00:07:49,930 --> 00:07:52,420
- What am I gonna do now? - Just pass the tape along.
-我該怎麼辦啦？ -就給你上司看看咯！

120
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,430
He's not right for the part.
他的確不適合演這個。

121
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:57,070
If I suggest him, my bosses will think I'm an idiot.
如果我推薦他 我的老闆會發現我是個傻瓜！

122
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,870
And that's something they should learn on their own.
我希望我的老闆能遲些才發現這一點

123
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:02,270
Just tell Joey that you watched the tape..
那就告訴喬伊你看過帶子

124
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,430
and you liked it, but your bosses didn't.
你很喜歡 但你的老闆們不喜歡。

125
00:08:04,610 --> 00:08:07,050
Then you're the good guy, and they're the bad guy.
那樣，你就成了好人，壞人就是你的老闆啦。

126
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:10,120
That's good. I liked it, they didn't.
好主意！我喜歡，老闆不喜歡。

127
00:08:11,990 --> 00:08:14,650
Joey, for God's sake, go to work.
喬伊，看在上帝份上，去工作啦！

128
00:08:20,060 --> 00:08:22,890
