Do you think there's any chance he'll bring Christie Brinkley or C-3PO?
他會不會帶上一些他喜歡的小玩偶來呢？

132
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:37,000
Sorry, it looks like it's just him.
對不起，看來他只孤身一人。

133
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:40,250
Charlie.
查莉！

134
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:46,380
My God, you look absolutely stunning.
天啊，你簡直美得讓我頭暈了。

135
00:08:46,550 --> 00:08:49,680
Well, I am having a good hair day.
是嗎？今天我特地去了理髮。

136
00:08:50,490 --> 00:08:54,290
- It's so good to see you. - Oh, you too.
- 見到你真好。 - 我也是。

137
00:08:57,900 --> 00:08:59,260
I'm okay.
我沒事。

138
00:09:00,130 --> 00:09:03,470
I'm sorry. Ross Geller, Benjamin Hobart.
對不起...羅斯.蓋勒 本傑明.哈伯特

139
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:06,770
It's an honor to meet you. I can't tell you how long..
很榮幸見到你。 我仰慕你都不知道多久了

140
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:11,880
I've been an admirer of your work. I mean, that Nobel Prize.
我是說，你得的諾貝爾獎，喔！

141
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:17,680
I mean, I have to tell you that you're one of the reasons I got into the field.
我得說 你是我從事科學工作的其中一個原因。

142
00:09:18,250 --> 00:09:19,740
Well, likewise.
噢，是嗎，我也是。

143
00:09:21,090 --> 00:09:23,890
Not likewise. I'd never heard of you until this morning.
其實，不一樣，我今早才第一次聽到你的名字。

144
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:25,650
But it's nice to be nice.
但，很高興能見到你。

145
00:09:27,730 --> 00:09:31,360
- Shall we? - Yeah. Thank you.
- 我們...？ - 好的！

146
00:09:33,940 --> 00:09:37,430
I can't believe that you chose this restaurant.
不能相信你選了這個餐館！ 

147
00:09:37,610 --> 00:09:41,670
- Do you remember the night? - Oh, my God. I completely forgot.
-你還記得那天晚上嗎？ -噢 天啊，我都已經想不起了！

148
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:47,140
Oh, my God, I can't believe they let us back in this place.
天啊，我們居然又在這裡碰頭了！

149
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:56,490
You weren't there.
你當時不在場！

150
00:09:57,160 --> 00:10:00,360
No, but, you know, it's just a funny image.
是不在，但想想都好笑

151
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:05,990
You know, the two of you in this restaurant with the..
想想你們兩個 在這個餐館，還...

152
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:12,730
Ross, why don't you tell Benji about your proposal while I go to the ladies' room.
羅斯 我去洗手間的時候你能告訴本你的方案嗎？

153
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,300
So tell me about it.
來吧，告訴我吧。

154
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:20,910
Okay. Well, I would like to do a dig in the Painted Desert.
我們會在沙漠裡進行挖掘.

155
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:24,280
There are still several areas that haven't been fully excavated.
因為裡面還有些地區還沒完全開挖的。

156
00:10:24,450 --> 00:10:25,780
- Break up with Charlie. - What?
-和查莉分手吧！ -什麼？

157
00:10:25,950 --> 00:10:27,320
What?
什麼？

158
00:10:28,420 --> 00:10:32,550
Did you just say, "Break up with Charlie"?
你剛才說 「和查莉分手」嗎？

159
00:10:33,590 --> 00:10:39,030
Well, yes and no. Yes, I did say it. And no, I didn't not say it.
可以說是，也可以說不是 是，我是這樣說了；不是，是我沒有否認。

160
00:10:40,070 --> 00:10:43,970
- Kind of inappropriate, don't you think? - Listen, I'm sorry.
-你不應該這樣說的，是嗎？ -對不起。

161
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:47,730
I just haven't seen her for so long, all these feelings are rushing back.
因為我太久沒有見她了！ 以前的感覺又湧上心頭！

162
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:50,240
I'm starting to realize how much I've missed her.
我覺得又喜歡上她了

163
00:10:50,410 --> 00:10:52,810
And I'm gonna need you to break up with her.
所以我想你和她分手

164
00:10:54,950 --> 00:10:57,610
- Are you serious? - If you say, yes, then I'm serious.
-你是說真的嗎？ -如果你說是，那我就是認真的

165
00:10:57,790 --> 00:11:00,080
If you say, no, then I'm joking.
如果你說不是，那我就是開玩笑！

166
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:03,320
- No. - Joking it is.
-不是！ -我開玩笑的！

167
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:10,330
- Hi, sorry I'm late. - Hey, how'd it go with Mike?
-嗨！對不起，我遲到了。 -嘿，和麥克談得怎樣？

168
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:14,430
- Is he gonna let you keep the painting? - No, he really hates it.
-他肯讓你保留那幅畫嗎？ -不行，他實在很討厭它

169
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:17,500
But he's gonna let me keep my box of human hair.
但他肯讓我留下我那盒頭髮！

170
00:11:18,770 --> 00:11:24,140
So you gotta pick your battles. But the good news is, Gladys is yours.
所以我只能妥協了。 但好消息是，格拉達斯已經屬於你了！

171
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:28,400
Wow, what's the bad news?
哇，那壞消息呢！？

172
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:32,050
- Who's Gladys? - Oh, she's that work of art I made.
-誰是格拉達斯？ -噢！她是我的手工作品，你見過啦

173
00:11:32,220 --> 00:11:34,950
You know, with the woman coming out of the frame.
就是有個女人從畫裡面走出來的那幅畫啊

174
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:39,590
And Monica gets to keep her?
噢，莫尼卡把她收下了嗎？

175
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:42,960
In her house? I am so jealous.
放在這個房間裡？我要嫉妒了！

176
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:46,930
I didn't know you wanted her too.
噢！我不知道你也想要她啊！

177
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:52,510
Well, I mean, sure, of course.
我..當然想要啊。

178
00:11:53,010 --> 00:11:55,170
But you already gave that to Monica, so..
但..你已經給了莫尼卡了，所以...

179
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:59,140
- You know, I would give her up for you. - No, I couldn't let you do that.
-為了你，我可以放棄她。 -不行，我不可以讓你這樣做的。

180
00:11:59,310 --> 00:12:01,650
- No, but I want to. - But I don't want you to.
-但我想這樣做。 -但我不想你這樣做。

181
00:12:01,820 --> 00:12:05,750
- But I insist. - But I insist harder.
-但我堅持！ -但我更堅持！

182
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,850
Girls. Girls. Stop. Okay, we'll flip a coin.
女生們！停一停好嗎？我們投硬幣決定吧。

183
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:13,220
Heads, she's Rachel's. Tails, she's Monica's.
正面，她是瑞秋的 反面，她就是莫尼卡的。

184
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:19,500
- Tails. Monica, she's yours. - No, that landed in your food.
-反面！莫尼卡，她是你的了！ -不行，它掉到你的食物裡了

185
00:12:20,530 --> 00:12:24,630
No, no, that's okay. You won fair and square. I'm so sad.
不，沒關係，該贏的就該贏。我太難過了。

186
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:31,140
Then the little red squirrel took all of his acorns..
然後紅色的小松鼠把他所有的橡子(果實)

187
00:12:31,310 --> 00:12:35,310
and put them in his little satchel and set off for..
放進他的小背包裡, 離開了

188
00:12:36,350 --> 00:12:39,380
Okay. Someone's getting a little fussy. I think it's time for bed.
好啦!有人開始煩啦 我看該睡覺了

189
00:12:40,490 --> 00:12:42,420
Where's the little red squirrel going?
小松鼠去哪了?

190
00:12:47,230 --> 00:12:48,920
Hey, Joe?
嘿 喬伊！

191
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,660
Oh, that's so sweet.
哦，太好了

192
00:12:57,610 --> 00:12:58,900
- What's up? - Bad news.
-什麼事？ -壞消息

193
00:12:59,070 --> 00:13:03,910
I watched the tape and passed it along to my bosses and they weren't interested.
我看過了帶子並把它交給我的老闆們 但他們不感興趣。

194
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:07,740
I'm sorry, man.
對不起，老兄。

195
00:13:08,950 --> 00:13:13,110
- But you watched the tape? - Yeah, I liked it.
-但...你看過這帶子嗎？ -是啊，我...我很喜歡啊！

196
00:13:14,290 --> 00:13:20,060
But my bosses didn't go for it. Stupid sons of bitches.
但...我的老闆不喜歡。真他媽的可惡！

197
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:28,990
- You didn't watch the tape. - What? Of course I did.
-你沒有看過這帶子。 -什麼！？我當然看啦！

198
00:13:29,170 --> 00:13:32,000
Look, it's one thing not to cast me, but to lie to me?
你不推薦我是一回事，但你對我說謊？

199
00:13:32,170 --> 00:13:35,300
- I'm not lying to you. I watched it. - You lied again.
-我沒有說謊啊，我看了啦！ -你看，又說謊！

200
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:38,600
- I watched it. - Keep going, Pinocchio.
-我看了！ -繼續說謊吧，匹諾曹！

201
00:13:39,810 --> 00:13:41,680
- I did. - No, you didn't.
-我看了！ -沒有！ 你沒看！

202
00:13:41,850 --> 00:13:43,910
I'm telling you, I watched the tape.
我告訴你，我看了這帶子。

203
00:13:45,920 --> 00:13:48,620
- Did you watch the tape? - No.
-你看過這帶子嗎？ -沒有

204
00:13:53,190 --> 00:13:56,960
Hi. Look, I realize only one of us can get this grant.
嗨, 聽著, 我知道我們中 只有一個人能得到認可

205
00:13:57,130 --> 00:14:00,430
And I just wanted to wish both of you the best of luck.
而我也想祝福你們所有人好運

206
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,590
Are you crossing your fingers?
你繞手指了?

207
00:14:03,870 --> 00:14:09,830
What, this? No. This.. That's just the result of a childhood injury.
什麼?這個?不, 這個... 只是童年受傷的結果

208
00:14:10,710 --> 00:14:13,150
I'm cured!
治好了！

209
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:16,610
Good morning, everybody.
大家早上好

210
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:19,310
If you go ahead and take your seats we can get started.
如果你坐到座位上 我們就可以開始了

211
00:14:19,690 --> 00:14:22,250
Actually, Dr. Hobart, can I have a word with you?
實際上，哈伯特博士 我能和你說句話嗎?

212
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,290
And you are?
你是...?

213
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:27,890
- Ross. - I know. I'm kidding.
- 羅斯 - 我知道, 開玩笑的

214
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:32,860
Listen, I just want to say, last night..
我只想說, 昨晚...

215
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:35,090
Dinner was a little awkward.
晚餐不太好

216
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:38,430
- I just wanna make sure we're okay. - Oh, yeah. Absolutely.
-我只想知道我們之間沒什麼問題 -沒問題!絕對沒有!

217
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:41,800
- You didn't tell Charlie what I said, did you? - Oh, no. Of course not.
- 你沒有告訴查莉我說過什麼吧? - 喔, 沒有, 當然沒有

218
00:14:42,180 --> 00:14:47,240
Well, thank you. I want you to know, I respect your decision not to give her up.
謝謝你, 我想讓你知道我尊重你 沒有放棄她的決定

219
00:14:47,410 --> 00:14:50,040
It was the biggest mistake I ever made in my whole life.
放棄她, 是我一生中最大的錯誤

220
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:53,810
Well, that and tattooing her name on my shoulder..
呃, 除了這件事 還有我很蠢的把她的名字刺在肩膀上...

221
00:14:54,460 --> 00:14:57,020
last night stupidly.
昨天晚上犯的蠢..

222
00:14:58,160 --> 00:14:59,150
Seriously?
真的?

223
00:14:59,330 --> 00:15:02,890
My Nobel Prize was not for moving on.
我的諾貝爾獎可不是為了繼續談論..

224
00:15:04,470 --> 00:15:07,160
- So no hard feelings? - None at all. Good luck today.
- 還難過嗎？ - 一點也沒有, 祝今天好運!

225
00:15:07,330 --> 00:15:09,000
- Thank you. - Okay.
- 謝謝 - 不客氣

226
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:13,940
All right. The selection committee has chosen the three of you as our finalists.
評選委員會選出你們三人於今天作最後評核。

227
00:15:14,110 --> 00:15:19,050
The ultimate decision will be based on the answers you give to the questions I ask.
最終決定會基於你們如何回答我的問題。

228
00:15:19,210 --> 00:15:21,480
We're gonna go ahead and start with Dr. Li.
先從李博士開始吧。

229
00:15:21,650 --> 00:15:25,810
You claim the field is too reliant on the Linnaean taxonomic system.
李博士 你提出學界太依賴林奈分類系統。

230
00:15:25,990 --> 00:15:28,150
How do you propose to correct this problem?
那你打算怎麼解決這個問題？

231
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:31,450
Well, I believe that the answers lie in the osteological evidence.
我相信解決辦法在化石證據上

232
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:33,490
- I plan to begin there. - Interesting.
-我打算從那裡入手 -很有趣

233
00:15:33,930 --> 00:15:35,660
I guess.
是嗎？

234
00:15:36,630 --> 00:15:40,570
Dr. Biely, your proposal includes some fieldwork. Where might that take place?
白莉博士，你的方案有一些挖掘工作 你會從哪裡入手呢？

235
00:15:40,730 --> 00:15:43,430
Primarily in the Pierre Shale region of South Dakota.
首先是南達科他州的Pierre Shale地區。

236
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:48,040
Certainly. Very well. And Dr. Geller, when is my birthday?
當然，很好。那蓋勒博士 你知道我的生日是什麼時候嗎？

237
00:15:54,350 --> 00:15:56,250
What? I..
什麼？我...我...

238
00:15:58,250 --> 00:16:00,410
Care to venture a guess?
不能猜一下嗎？

239
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:06,950
- May 12? - That's not even kind of close.
-5月12號？ -還差很遠呢！

240
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:10,400
Dr. Li, how many graduate students will you need?
李博士，你需要要多少個學生呢？

241
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:12,500
- Half a dozen. - I see. And Dr. Biely?
- 6個 -明白了，那白莉博士呢？

242
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:14,960
Three for excavation, and two for analysis.
三個負責開掘，兩個負責分析。

243
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:19,200
Certainly. Dr. Geller, which 1965 Shirelles hit..
當然。蓋勒博士，1965年沙倫斯樂隊

244
00:16:19,370 --> 00:16:22,400
was later covered by a popular British Invasion band?
被哪支英國樂隊蓋過風頭？

245
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:28,570
What? I need six graduate students.
什麼...？我需要6個學生。

246
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:32,550
No, I'm sorry. We were looking for "Baby It's You."
不是！對不起 答案是 「Baby It's You」（寶貝，就是你）

247
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,090
"Baby It's You."
寶貝，就是你。

248
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:38,020
What? Wait just a minute.
什麼...？等等，等一下。

249
00:16:38,190 --> 00:16:41,360
None of my questions have anything to do with paleontology.
我的問題沒有一條是關於古生物學的。

250
00:16:41,530 --> 00:16:44,000
You're right, I apologize. Scratch the last question.
沒錯，我該道歉。 那最後一條問題

251
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:46,390
Spell "Boscodictiasaur."
拼寫單詞Boscodictiasaur。

252
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:52,000
I've never heard of a "Boscodictiasaur."
恩....我沒有聽過Boscodictiasaur啊。

253
00:16:52,170 --> 00:16:54,500
Yeah, I just made it up. Spell it.
是，我亂編的單詞。快拼。

254
00:16:57,340 --> 00:17:00,800
- Okay. B-O.. - No, it starts with a silent M.
-好的。B - O - S ... -不，開頭有個不發音的「M」。

255
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:03,210
Oh, come on!
噢，拜託！

256
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:13,050
I can't believe Joey. I hate being called a liar.
我不明白喬伊，我討厭被人稱為騙子。

257
00:17:13,230 --> 00:17:14,660
But you are a liar.
但你是個騙子。

258
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,960
What did I just say?
我剛剛怎麼說的？

259
00:17:19,330 --> 00:17:20,630
- Are you still here? - Yes.
-你還在啊？ -是的，而且我還有話說

260
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:25,600
And I'm not just hurt, I'm insulted. When I tell somebody I did something..
我不僅僅是受傷害，我感覺被侮辱了一樣。 當我說我已經做了某事...

261
00:17:25,770 --> 00:17:29,610
Okay, hold on, let me just stop you right there, okay? First, you lied. Right?
好了好了... 我打斷你一下好嗎？ 首先，你說謊，對嗎？

262
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:32,340
Then you lied about lying, okay?
然後，你又說謊去圓謊，好嗎？

263
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:35,410
Then you lied about lying about lying, okay?
然後，你又再說謊去圓你剛才圓的謊 是不是？

264
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:40,990
So before you lie about lying about lying about lying about lying..
所以在你說謊去圓你剛才 為圓謊...而說的謊...的那個謊言...

265
00:17:42,990 --> 00:17:44,860
Stop lying.
不要說謊啦！

266
00:17:45,030 --> 00:17:47,650
Why are you so sure I didn't watch this tape?
為什麼你這麼肯定我沒有看過那帶子？

267
00:17:47,830 --> 00:17:49,920
You wanna know why? You wanna know why?
你想知道...? 你想知道為什麼？

268
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:52,360
Well, this is going well.
事情發展得不錯呢。

269
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:55,500
Here's how I know you didn't watch.
這就是我知道你沒看的原因了。

270
00:17:55,670 --> 00:18:00,540
If you had seen what was on this tape, believe me, you'd have some comments.
如果你看了這帶子，你絕對不會沒有話說的。

271
00:18:00,710 --> 00:18:03,510
All right, remember, I got paid a lot of money for this..
聽好，我收了很多錢才去拍這個廣告

272
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,870
and it only aired in Japan.
而且只在日本地區放映。

273
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:08,480
Ichiban.
一級棒

274
00:18:09,850 --> 00:18:12,010
Ichiban, lipstick for men.
男用唇膏！

275
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:27,790
Ichiban, lipstick for men.
男用唇膏！

276
00:18:31,540 --> 00:18:33,970
And that's how I know you didn't watch the tape.
這就是我知道你沒看的原因！

277
00:18:37,010 --> 00:18:39,410
He really is a chameleon.
他真的是一條變色龍呢。

278
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:50,550
Well, Gladys, say hello to your new home.
格拉達斯，給你的新家打個招呼吧！

279
00:18:53,730 --> 00:18:56,390
- Oh, my. - Wow.
-我的...！ -哇！

280
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:59,790
Oh, she is so nice and big.
噢！她真漂亮，又顯眼！

281
00:19:01,670 --> 00:19:07,830
Oh, Monica, where are you going to display Gladys, oh, so proudly?
噢！莫尼卡，你會把她放到什麼地方 讓格拉達斯顯的得體呢？

282
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:13,110
- I haven't really settled on a spot yet. - How about right above the TV?
-我還沒決定放在哪裡！ -那，不如放在電視機上面吧！

283
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:17,770
That way, it will be the first thing that you see when you walk in the door.
這樣的話，人們一進門就馬上看得到了！

284
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:22,450
Yeah, yeah, and you can get rid of that French poster.
好啊，好啊！那你就可以丟掉那法國的海報了。

285
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,560
- I like that poster. - Really?
-我喜歡那海報啊！ -是嗎？

286
00:19:25,030 --> 00:19:27,190
It doesn't have anything coming out of it.
它沒有東西可以「冒」出來啊。

287
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:30,700
Or maybe there's someplace for her in your bedroom?
又或者你的臥室裡有空位嗎？

288
00:19:30,860 --> 00:19:34,630
- There's nothing above your bed. - Are you still here?
-噢！你床頭還空著呢！ -你還在這裡住嗎？

289
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:41,470
Stupid Nobel Prize winner.
愚蠢的諾貝爾獎獲得者！

290
00:19:47,810 --> 00:19:49,650
Oh, hi. Hello.
噢！嗨！你好！

291
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:54,250
Have you come to ask me some more paleontology-related questions?
呃，你是來問我古生物學的問題的嗎？

292
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:58,550
Your grandmother's nickname, perhaps? Ann-Margret's pant size?
呃...可能你要問我你祖母的小名吧？ 還是你馬格莉特阿姨內褲的尺寸？

293
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:05,590
I've come here to apologize. I think I may have let my feelings..
我是來道歉的。 我想我對查莉的感情…

294
00:20:05,770 --> 00:20:08,430
for Charlie interfere with the interview process.
影響到面試的程序了

295
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,700
No. Stop.
沒有！哪裡有！

296
00:20:11,410 --> 00:20:14,340
Anyway, I decided to offer you the grant.
不管怎麼說，我決定批准你的補助金。

297
00:20:16,010 --> 00:20:20,540
- Really? - There is just one small stipulation.
-真的嗎？ -是的...只是還有一個...條件...

298
00:20:20,980 --> 00:20:24,850
- I have to break up with Charlie? - Hey, you got one right.
-我要和查莉分手？ -嘿！你終於答對一次了！

299
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:30,790
- You're crazy. - Crazy or romantic?
-你發神經。 -神經，還是...浪漫？

300
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:32,620
Crazy.
神經！

301
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:36,820
- Or? - Get out!
-還是... -出去！

302
00:20:43,770 --> 00:20:44,860
Oh, my God.
噢！天啊！

303
00:20:46,970 --> 00:20:51,340
- What? - Joey, what is this thing doing here?
-什麼？ -喬伊，這..這...東西在這裡幹嘛？

304
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:56,310
I got her from Monica. She sold it to me for a very reasonable price.
我在莫尼卡那裡拿過來的 她出了個很合理的價格。

305
00:20:56,480 --> 00:21:00,110
- Joey, we're not keeping this. - But it's an original Buffay.
-喬伊，我們不能留著這個！ -但它是原版的布費作品啊...

306
00:21:03,290 --> 00:21:06,020
All right, fine. You can keep it.
好的，沒關係，你就留著吧。

307
00:21:06,190 --> 00:21:08,560
As long as you don't mind that she's haunted.
只要你不介意她周圍遊蕩。

308
00:21:08,730 --> 00:21:10,250
Hey, what? What?
嘿？什麼？什麼？嘿！噢！什麼！？

309
00:21:10,660 --> 00:21:15,190
Well, legend has it, Joey, that she comes alive when you're asleep.
有這樣一個傳說...她在半夜裡會活過來。

310
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:20,500
She climbs out of the frame..
她爬出這畫框

311
00:21:20,670 --> 00:21:24,970
and then drags her half-a-body across the floor..
然後她拖著她這半個身體，爬在地板上

312
00:21:25,150 --> 00:21:26,980
just looking for legs to steal.
想辦法去偷一雙腿

313
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:30,780
And then with her one good hand..
然後她用她唯一的一隻手

314
00:21:30,950 --> 00:21:34,910
she slowly reaches up..
慢慢、慢慢地

315
00:21:35,090 --> 00:21:37,320
and turns your doorknob.
扭開門把手

316
00:21:37,490 --> 00:21:41,290
Get that legless witch out of here!
拿走這沒腳的妖怪！！

317
00:21:46,730 --> 00:21:49,900
- Hey, I sold that to Joey. - Yeah, well, I told him it's haunted.
-嘿！我把它賣給喬伊了！ -所以我騙他這是鬼怪了

318
00:21:50,070 --> 00:21:52,900
- Two can play at this game. - Too late. You can't give it back.
-我們都會玩這種把戲 -不行，太遲了，你不能退貨！

319
00:21:53,070 --> 00:21:55,270
- Oh, yes, I can. - No, you can't, she's yours.
-我當然可以！ -不，你不可以，她是你的 ！

320
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:56,840
- She's yours. - She's yours.
-她是你的！ -是你的！

321
00:21:57,010 --> 00:21:59,410
- She's yours. - Hey.
-她是你的！ -嘿！

322
00:22:00,950 --> 00:22:02,470
- She's mine. - She's mine.
-她是我的！ -是我--的！

323
00:22:02,650 --> 00:22:04,510
- She's mine. - She's mine.
-她是我的！ -她是我的！

324
00:22:04,690 --> 00:22:07,920
You guys, you don't have to fight over her anymore.
你們啊！不用為她爭吵了。

325
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:11,520
Whoever doesn't get Gladys, gets Glynnis.
誰得不到格拉達斯，就把格林妮斯拿回去吧。

326
00:22:19,730 --> 00:22:21,890
- I want Gladys. - She's mine.
-我要格拉達斯。 -她是我的！

327
00:22:22,070 --> 00:22:24,060
- She's mine. - She's mine.
-她是我的！ -她是我的！

328
00:22:31,850 --> 00:22:33,470
No, no. You don't get to do that.
不要不要.你們不要這樣了

329
00:22:33,650 --> 00:22:36,950
I know. Look, I'm sorry I didn't give them your tape.
很抱歉我沒有把你的帶子給他們。

330
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:41,140
And I promise next time to submit you, whether I think you're right or not.
我保證，下次無論合不合適我都會把你推薦上去的。

331
00:22:41,320 --> 00:22:44,310
That's not the point, Chandler. The point is that you lied.
重點不是這個啊錢德。 重點是，你說了謊

332
00:22:44,490 --> 00:22:49,090
I know. You're right. What's it gonna take for you to forgive me?
我知道，你說的對 我要做什麼你才能原諒我？

333
00:22:49,260 --> 00:22:50,320
Oh, my God.
噢 天啊！

334
00:22:54,600 --> 00:22:56,660
Excellent.
無得彈！

335
00:22:57,600 --> 00:23:00,040
Now what do you say?
現在你該說什麼？

336
00:23:00,210 --> 00:23:02,400
Lying is wrong.
說謊是不對的！

337
00:23:02,580 --> 00:23:05,070
And? And?
還有呢？...還有呢？

338
00:23:06,850 --> 00:23:09,610
I'm a pretty little girl.
我是個漂亮美眉。

339
00:23:11,280 --> 00:23:12,720
I knew it.
我早就知道啦！

340
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:23,690
Your ex-boyfriend is insane.
你的前男友是個瘋子。

341
00:23:24,400 --> 00:23:26,230
- He is a character. - No, no, no.
-他是個有個性的人 -不是, 才不是呢

342
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:29,490
Charles Nelson Reilly is a character.
查爾斯·納爾遜·賴利才是

343
00:23:30,070 --> 00:23:32,540
- Who? - Charles Nelson Reilly.
- 誰? - 查爾斯·納爾遜·賴利

344
00:23:32,710 --> 00:23:35,830
The Ghost and Mrs. Muir? Match Game?
The Ghost and Mrs. Muir? Match Game?（兩個電影名）

345
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,840
Were you never sick as a child?
你小時侯都沒得過病嗎?

346
00:23:40,610 --> 00:23:43,810
- Whatever. Did you get the grant? - No. And you wanna know why?
- 隨便啦！ 你得到那筆補助了嗎？ - 沒有，你想知道為什麼嗎？

347
00:23:43,980 --> 00:23:47,250
Because your ex-boyfriend is still in love with you.
因為你的前男友還是愛著你。

348
00:23:47,420 --> 00:23:48,450
- What? - Yeah.
-什麼？ -沒錯

349
00:23:48,620 --> 00:23:50,990
He refused me because I wouldn't give you up.
他沒有給我那筆補助，就因為我沒有放棄你。

350
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:54,420
Benji isn't in love with me. I mean, he broke up with me.
本不會還愛著我的。 因為當時是他拋棄我

351
00:23:54,590 --> 00:23:58,930
- And besides, he's a very ethical man. - Really?
-而且，他是個認真的人。 -是嗎？？？

352
00:23:59,670 --> 00:24:02,430
Is it ethical to ask someone in a grant review:
在補助調查中問這種問題：

353
00:24:02,600 --> 00:24:04,470
"Who was the voice of Underdog?"
「誰是Underdog（電影名）的配音員？」  很認真嗎？

354
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:06,860
I'm sure he was just joking.
我肯定他是在開玩笑，羅斯。

355
00:24:07,040 --> 00:24:09,240
If you don't believe me, let's go talk to him.
如果你不相信我，我們去找他對質吧。

356
00:24:09,410 --> 00:24:12,470
I'm telling you, he didn't ask me one paleontological question.
可以告訴你 他沒有問過我一個關於考古學的問題

357
00:24:12,650 --> 00:24:15,580
- Seriously? - Oh, I'm sorry. No, he did ask me one:
-真的嗎？ -哦，不是，他問了我一個。

358
00:24:15,750 --> 00:24:18,080
"How do you spell Boscodictiasaur?"
呃...怎麼拼Mboscodictiosaur

359
00:24:18,250 --> 00:24:21,780
Well, if it's like the Lake Mbosco in Congo, then M-B-O..
和剛果的Mbosco湖拼法一樣，那是M-B-O...

360
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,120
Damn it.
可惡！

361
00:24:26,760 --> 00:24:29,990
Dr. Geller. Charlie, what are you doing here?
蓋勒博士...？查莉  你...你到這來幹什麼？

362
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:32,060
I want you to tell her everything.
我要你告訴他一切。

363
00:24:32,230 --> 00:24:35,900
About the deal you tried to make with me, about the crazy questions you..
告訴他你想和我做的交易，那些神經病的問題

364
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:41,370
Wally Cox. That's the voice of Underdog.
沃利·考克斯！他就是Underdog的配音！

365
00:24:42,180 --> 00:24:44,270
Like I tried to tell you in the interview..
就如之前的調查我告訴你一樣

366
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:48,380
this grant is not based on your knowledge of pretty useless trivia.
這個補助基金不是為了這些無聊的知識而設的

367
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:53,510
No, don't do that. I want you to look her in the eyes and tell her the truth.
不！不！不！別這樣！ 我要你看著她的眼睛，告訴她真相。

368
00:24:54,750 --> 00:24:55,850
Benji?
Benji?

369
00:24:57,060 --> 00:25:01,890
All right. It's true. I behaved horribly, but it's only because I still love you.
是的，的確是這樣。我之前簡直是亂來。 但這都是因為我還愛著你。

370
00:25:02,060 --> 00:25:05,000
And I would do anything to have you back in my life.
只要你回到我身邊，我可以做任何事。

371
00:25:05,170 --> 00:25:07,830
Too little, too late, Benji.
太少了，太遲了，Benji！

372
00:25:08,900 --> 00:25:13,030
- I can't believe this. - I never should've broken up with you.
-我不敢相信。 -我真不應該離開你

373
00:25:13,210 --> 00:25:18,230
I think about you all the time. Do you ever still think about me?
我無時無刻不想起你。 難道你一點都沒有想起我?

374
00:25:18,410 --> 00:25:19,900
No.
沒有!

375
00:25:20,780 --> 00:25:23,110
- Yes. - What?
-有! -什麼?

376
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:27,880
I don't know what to say, Benji. This is all so..
我不知道該說什麼好了，Benji。 這一切實在太...

377
00:25:28,050 --> 00:25:30,110
romantic.
浪漫了

378
00:25:30,620 --> 00:25:32,150
Or?
或者...

379
00:25:34,900 --> 00:25:37,090
I know I may be way out of bounds here..
我知道，或者我做得太過火了

380
00:25:37,260 --> 00:25:40,720
but is there any chance you would take me back?
但我們還有機會在一起嗎？

381
00:25:43,270 --> 00:25:45,400
Maybe.
或者可以...

382
00:25:45,570 --> 00:25:49,470
Sweetie, this conversation is starting to make me a little uncomfortable.
甜心，你們的對話讓我覺得有點不舒服了。

383
00:25:51,140 --> 00:25:54,910
Oh, God. I am so sorry, but..
噢 天啊！我很抱歉，但...

384
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:59,850
I mean, there's so much history between us, you know?
我是說...我們之前有太多的過去了...

385
00:26:00,050 --> 00:26:02,520
I'm sorry too.
我也覺得抱歉...

386
00:26:10,600 --> 00:26:14,290
- I love you. - I love you too.
-我愛你! -噢! 我也愛你!

387
00:26:16,270 --> 00:26:19,330
Okay, that's it, we are seeing other people.
好了, 夠了。我們算是完了！

388
00:26:39,090 --> 00:26:40,080
Gladys?
格拉達斯?

389
00:26:47,130 --> 00:26:50,900
For the third time this week. Man, this does not get old.
哈哈哈，這個星期的第三次了。 老兄，你怎麼還沒長大啊？

390
00:26:52,370 --> 00:26:56,210
- You're mean! - Oh, don't be such a baby. Please.
-你真可惡！ -不要這麼孩子氣啦！

391
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


392
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


